WEBVTT

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:06.690
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.170
Return the field to default!

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:17.980
Load routine 312.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:19.080
Locked on target.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.600
No errors with the coordinate axes.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:22.120
Phase 4, fire.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.910
I've sent the YK Solid using F4.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.810
Okay. I'm bringing up the field again.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:27.490
Why don't you have the sub room do that?

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:29.650
Cullen! Create a Solid so we're
prepared for the fifth wave.

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:31.660
Already done. Yuki!

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.630
Not enough. Give me AT-26.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:36.920
Got it?

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:18.370
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:25.810
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:29.820
Although loneliness...

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:34.150
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:41.390
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:46.470
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:49.440
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:56.970
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:01:57.740 --> 00:02:00.750
...the dream and the reality...

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:04.380
...that you saw cross paths

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:08.080
Some light is shed...

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:12.660
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:19.890
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:27.900
The things I want have no shape

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:36.310
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:50.490
If Only to Meet

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.360
<i>Operation complete. The unmanned</i>
<i>observation satellites are destroyed.</i>

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:55.830
<i>Switching to the return sequence.</i>

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.670
Phew. It's over, finally.

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:07.700
What? Only five points?

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:10.880
All right! Mine's increased by 14 points!

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:13.520
Damn you! You should go on a diet
and reduce your food intake!

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:15.910
Look. It's the main guys.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:18.250
They're not on the point
system. Must be nice.

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:20.420
That girl's curried favor with Blue.

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:22.720
Quiet. She might hear you.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:24.990
Never know what he'd do
to you if he hears you.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.360
How nice to be a king.

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.170
He's got all the best looking
girls working for him.

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:35.240
You did well.

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:38.230
I'm not doing it for you.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:51.290
Okay, next person! Okay!
Now, line up over there!

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:54.880
Take your empty dishes over
there! Okay, next order?

00:03:55.190 --> 00:03:58.420
Sorry, I've only got 4 points,
but can I at least have a bun?

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.260
I'd really like to...!

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:02.560
<i>Ground crew, team 7!</i>

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:05.440
<i>Mealtime is up! Prepare to return to work!</i>

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:09.440
Stop trying to boss us around! How many
hours are you making us work, anyway?

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:14.710
Emerson Elby. Your rebellious
attitude has just cost you 10 points.

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:17.350
Wha...! There goes today's earnings.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:19.110
Emerson, you fool!

00:04:19.350 --> 00:04:20.910
I'm sorry.

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:25.750
All right! All right!

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:29.330
<i>Transfer containers E64</i>
<i>through 87 to the Lift Ship.</i>

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:31.390
<i>The others are to go to</i>
<i>the adjacent blocks!</i>

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.130
<i>You've got three hours!</i>

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:37.360
<i>Remember, you lose a point</i>
<i>for every hour you're late!</i>

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:40.040
Damn!

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:45.410
That guy's with the bridge crew, right?
He looks like he's got time on his hands.

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:46.780
That pisses me off!

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:48.940
Must be nice to be given a
status with special privileges.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:55.280
Water is a very important
commodity for us.

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:59.090
Anyone using more water than the
standard ration will be deducted a point...

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:01.420
...plus will be required to
work an additional six hours.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:06.430
What's that outfit you're dressed
in? You think that's funny?

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.800
Wh-What do you think
you're doing? How rude!

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:10.390
How dare you wear that Zwei
uniform in front of us!

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:12.700
You find it fun threatening us?

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:13.930
I have no such intention...!

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:16.270
Take off that ambiguous uniform!

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:18.470
Stop it! Not here out in the open!

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:20.800
Help!!

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:22.410
What is it?

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:23.400
It's Lucson.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:28.020
Hey, Chic! Reprimand them for me!

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:35.960
H-Hey! Please don't ignore me!

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:42.060
Hey! Uh, stop it. I'm Zwei's
training leader. Ah! No!

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:45.970
I don't wanna be charged
for public indecency!

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:47.970
<i>Lucson!</i>

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:51.840
<i>This is no longer a normal society.</i>
<i>This is the Ryvius.</i>

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:58.850
Since we introduced the point system,
crediting people for their work...

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:02.050
...food consumption has been reduced an
average 53 percent of previous levels.

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:03.920
Things are working well!

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:06.080
But I've received all kinds
of complaints by mail.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:09.020
And there are some strange dudes
out there reigning supreme.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:11.230
All of this is necessary evil.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.900
I'm grateful for anything
that'll reduce tension.

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:16.030
Certainly.

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:19.540
The point system was designed
taking that into consideration.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:23.270
Remove emotional disposition, and a
person inevitably becomes obedient.

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:26.610
<i>Obedient? It's more like forced labor.</i>

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:29.240
When will we run outta food?

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:31.740
At this rate, in a little over six months.

00:06:31.980 --> 00:06:34.450
We must find some place that
will take us in before then.

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:38.720
Judging from our present position, that
would mean either Jupiter or Saturn.

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:41.920
Our course has been altered
to take us to Saturn.

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:43.190
Why?

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:45.990
That planet has formed an
independent government.

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:49.290
They've expressed their disapproval
of intervention by other planets...

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:52.400
...and left most governmental duties to
the planet's self-governing bodies.

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:54.430
The Alliance will likely be very
cautious dealing with Saturn.

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:58.170
So we'd be okay if we could get even one
of its autonomies on our side, right?

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.270
If that's the case, then I agree.

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:03.610
But I hear there's a lot of disorder there.

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:06.250
I thought you wanted to survive.

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:09.250
Well, it's decided. Kouji.

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:12.150
Later, post a message to the rest
of the ship about this decision.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:13.620
All right.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:18.960
What's this?

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:22.020
It's data for the Vital Guarder that was
pending from our last defense meeting.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:24.640
What do you need that for?

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:25.940
That's a secret!

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:26.930
Is that so!

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:31.570
Thank you for walking with me here.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:32.980
No problem.

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:35.840
There seems to be a number of open
rooms, why not move to this section?

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:39.480
Well, Ikumi and the others say they're
remaining in the other section.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.580
I don't feel comfortable
moving out alone.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:45.390
Too bad. I wouldn't mind sharing
a room, if it was with you.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.990
I'm joking! Did I startle you?

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:58.740
If you change your mind,
feel free to come by!

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:01.760
Oh, and please apologize to Aoi and the
others for me for leaving Rafra with them!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.010
I'll let them know!

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.680
<i>How can she be so cheerful?</i>

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:11.650
<i>Is it just the way people think</i>
<i>from the vicinity of Uranus?</i>

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.260
Welcome!

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:27.970
Criff, let me in!

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:29.560
Stop being a pest!

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:31.440
I wanna know why.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.560
I was the one who got you this room!

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:37.470
The ship now belongs to Blue,
so you're no longer of any use to me.

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:40.610
Come on! You mean you were
only playing me like a toy?

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:41.670
Exactly!

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:43.550
What is it, Criff?

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:45.540
You're being pathetic, Charlie.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:48.180
Brian? What are you doing here?

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:52.990
Get outta my sight!

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:57.180
I-I'm the only one capable of
loving you. Because you're...!

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.390
My. How sweet, Charlie.

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.230
If you say another word, I'll kill you!

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:08.160
Thanks for everything. Goodbye!

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:16.710
Charlotte. I'm leaving my
points for you right here.

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:19.680
Thank you, Johnson. I love you.

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:25.720
R-Really? Okay, I'm gonna
work as hard again tomorrow!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.830
You are wicked!

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:32.460
He's the one offering
to give me his points.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.340
That's good! Nice!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.330
You sound like an old woman.

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:42.700
Why do you work until
you're in such shape?

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:45.510
Both Ikumi and Kouji
have unlimited points.

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:47.300
Why not have them get you stuff?

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.240
Call it woman's nature.

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:53.520
I'm so glad you two are
close to Ikumi and Kouji.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.380
Let's remain great friends, okay?

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:58.920
A friendship with a price tag on it...!

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:01.750
I think it's better than faking
a friendship, don't you think?

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:04.400
Well, that's true.

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:05.830
Hey, can I come in?

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.290
Ah, sure!

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:10.600
We're on our way to get sheets from
the materials section. Want anything?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.840
Yes, yes! There are many things!

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:16.130
R-Really?

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:18.970
Kouji! I'll go to the
materials section with them...

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:22.140
...so why don't you remain here and get
some rest?! I'll go get the cart!

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:24.410
Ah, but...!

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:28.680
It's okay. But could you look
after that old lady in there?

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:30.050
Old lady?

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.860
Hurry, hurry!

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:34.890
Okay, already.

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:40.590
You're trying too hard.

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:43.330
Shut up.

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:47.390
I know that this isn't
gonna go on forever.

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:49.210
Then why continue?

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:51.740
What would you do?

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:54.940
Considering the present situation, everyone's
feelings, the remaining food stock...

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:57.880
...the most beneficial is
not the best scenario.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.250
You're escaping from reality.

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:04.310
I agree. But it's no different
from the society we lived in.

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:06.920
There's a need to consider the
feelings of all kinds of people.

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:09.590
You have to turn the other
cheek to some things.

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:10.750
You sound like a cynic.

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:14.490
But unlike you, I must earn my points!

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:17.740
But you can use my ID to...!

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:21.300
I don't wanna cheat! I don't want any
charity from someone with special status.

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:22.640
I'm working too!

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.010
You're doing it for Faina!

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:27.670
Th-That's not true! What's wrong
with you? This isn't like you!

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:29.780
Let me complain a little at least!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.240
Why at me?

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:32.620
Because you're Kouji!

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:34.020
That just doesn't make sense!

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:37.250
Why have you changed so much?

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:39.250
I've known you since we were little kids!

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:57.600
Oww...!

00:11:58.340 --> 00:11:59.740
What do you think you're doing? Clumsy.

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:02.740
It was an accident! An accident!

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:03.980
Hey...!

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:07.070
What's gonna happen to us?

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:11.080
Well...! How should I know?

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:17.420
Pat. You wait here for a moment.

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:30.800
Gran. I cannot believe
that you betrayed us.

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:40.080
Hang in there. I'll do my best as well.

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:43.380
I intend to give my best effort.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:48.960
Infinite Ryvius

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.160
Infinite Ryvius

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:02.270
Hey, you. You're a Vital
Guarder pilot, aren't you?

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:04.270
Lend me your ID.

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:06.440
You guys have unlimited points, right?

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:07.980
Not a chance, you fool.

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:09.480
What did you say?

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:11.880
Just because you're treated specially
doesn't mean you should act it!

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:16.880
You're resentment's unjustified.
It's simply because you guys lack ability!

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:19.110
If you haven't got the brains,
then work honestly!

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:21.620
You're very direct with your response!

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:23.920
You're just too cool, you brat!

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:34.970
We're back!

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:37.770
Juli. What are you checking?

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:40.740
Huh? Oh, nothing much.

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:44.210
Lucson Houjou here.
I brought Pat Campbell.

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:47.880
Thank you, as always.

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:50.890
What happened to you, Lucson?

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:53.880
I-I thought I'd give
myself a different look.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:56.130
Lucson had his pants ripped off.

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:57.950
P-Pat!

00:13:58.200 --> 00:13:59.600
He looked like a dork.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:02.190
Well, um... you see...!

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:05.830
I'm so sorry. You were
protecting Pat, weren't you?

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:10.070
Y-Yeah, that's right. That's exactly it.

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.310
How is Gran doing?

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:16.970
He is eating. I think he's all right.

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.310
I see. If you have a moment,
won't you stop by for some tea?

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:24.780
W-Well. I am quite busy with stuff,
but just for a little while.

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.080
Lucson's coming in.

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:28.860
Why, oh why?

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:32.750
What was that?

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.430
Huh? Reiko.

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:35.930
Oh, hi!

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:38.370
Look at this! How'd you
get all this, Reiko?

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.700
Don't talk so casually to your elders!

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:43.840
May I ask how you received
all these items, Miss Reiko?

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:45.610
Call it a secret weapon.

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:47.370
Ikumi's ID, I bet.

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:48.910
You are correct!

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:50.670
I'd be careful walking alone with that.

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:53.440
Management's strict, and
everyone's pretty edgy.

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:56.280
That's right. If anyone
were to assault you...

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:58.250
...well, in your case, I
guess there's no worry.

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:02.020
But there were three of us originally!

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:03.020
What do you mean?

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:06.300
True friendship!

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.340
Thanks to true friendship.

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:17.140
Huh, what did you say?

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:18.270
N-Nothing.

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:23.110
I'm so glad you're cheerful again.

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:26.440
You wouldn't stop crying
when we left Mars.

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:29.720
I was feeling so worried then.

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:33.220
But I've grown numb to it.
Maybe I'm getting used to anxiety.

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.620
You must've lived a happy
life up to that point.

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:40.320
So-so. I'm an only child, so I can
be selfish and get away with it.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:44.700
Although there were heated discussions
when I decided to join Liebe Delta.

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:46.370
Is that so.

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:48.960
What about you, Ikumi? Why
did you come to Liebe Delta?

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:51.670
Because I could find a job
if I got a level two license.

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:54.800
Don't give me that again.
Tell me the truth.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:58.410
I want to know more about you, Ikumi.

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:00.710
There's really nothing about
me worth talking about.

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:04.580
Ikumi... tell me...!

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.490
Tell you what?

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.480
That you'll protect me.

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:10.920
Please. Let me hear it.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.060
I'll protect you.

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:23.830
Promise... me.

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:42.390
This isn't right!

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:43.360
What's not?

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:44.950
I didn't get a buzz!

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:50.400
Well, I can't really help that.
Actually, only you have control over that.

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.230
It's not right! It's not right!

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:54.670
You're being TOO selfish.

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:57.710
It's gotta be so that the
romantic feeling will never stop.

00:16:57.710 --> 00:16:58.500
<i>Where do you get these ideas?</i>

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:06.440
How do you get into fights,
day after day? I'm amazed. Really.

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:08.980
How many today?

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:10.720
Four guys.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:15.350
You've convinced me that you're a damn
good fighter, so why not call it quits?

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:19.590
I'll quit when I'm able
to get even with Blue.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:22.570
You're never satisfied until
you've done everything, are you?

00:17:22.570 --> 00:17:24.660
Are you that bothered about
your brother's presence?

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:27.330
Right on, wasn't I?

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:31.600
Sorry! You angry?

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:35.310
Not really.

00:17:46.690 --> 00:17:49.250
<i>As I thought. This ship's</i>
<i>system is still incomplete.</i>

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:52.030
<i>An intentional omission?</i>

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:54.660
<i>But if so, why did Ryvius move?</i>

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:58.470
<i>And why did a field</i>
<i>develop all on its own...</i>

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.000
<i>... when we were under attack by</i>
<i>the Orbital Security Bureau?</i>

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:04.830
<i>Perhaps this has to do with the</i>
<i>Vital Guarder's substance!</i>

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:06.170
Hey, Heiger!

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:09.010
I'm thirsty. Get me some tea!

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:13.180
Serving you drinks is not my job.
Why not ask Kouji?

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:15.750
Forget it. I'm just joking.

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:18.490
Why don't you ever laugh,
honor student?

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:23.790
Ready, set...!

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:27.260
Congratulations on your first kiss!

00:18:27.260 --> 00:18:28.750
How do you know?

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:33.370
<i>Don't tell me you used this to!</i>

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:34.830
I believe you're right on!

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:37.370
"This isn't right! I don't get a buzz!"

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:40.500
I can't believe you guys!

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:43.750
Come on. Calm down.

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:45.370
How do you expect me to calm down?

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:48.980
Sorry, Kozue. These guys
have no sense of delicacy.

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:52.180
We're congratulating you!
You should be happy!

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:54.920
They got us this time.

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:59.660
And why aren't <i>you</i> bothered by this?

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:56.280
<i>If this didn't hurt, I could believe it.</i>
<i>This can't possibly be reality.</i>

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:08.050
Airs Blue. Birthplace,
Hyperion, Vicinity of Saturn.

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:13.270
Father serves as self-governed territory's
vice-minister of the Ministry of Defense.

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:14.370
Explain that to me.

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:15.940
That's my profile.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.540
Don't try to talk yourself out of it.

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:19.940
What do you plan to do
once we get to Hyperion?

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:23.170
We'll look for some
place that'll accept us.

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:27.420
You're planning to go to your
father with the Ryvius as a gift?

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:30.420
Who knows?

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:31.910
Did you plan all this?

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:33.920
Don't be ridiculous.

00:20:34.430 --> 00:20:36.720
How many people have sacrificed
their lives as a result?

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:41.230
I won't forgive you!

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:43.530
I won't...!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:55.970
The neutrino pinger is
responding to something.

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:03.150
<i>Why... I... I can't</i>
<i>stand you. Then why...?</i>

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:06.950
Def-con three. Def-con three.
Neutrino pinger responding!

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:10.530
There's a silhouette of an unidentified
ship approaching from the Ryvius's fore.

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:13.150
Main crew and Vital Guarder pilots...

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:16.090
...get to your respective
positions at once. I repeat.

00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:17.670
There's a silhouette of an unidentified...!

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.000
Enemies!

00:21:19.100 --> 00:21:20.800
They've come to get beat up!

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:22.070
- <i>and Vital Guarder pilots...</i>
- Again?

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:23.730
<i>... get to your respective positions at once.</i>

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:26.880
I'll wipe them out!

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:30.810
It's meaningless. They have
no chance against the Ryvius!

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:32.950
Go get 'em!

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:34.280
Enemy?

00:21:47.060 --> 00:21:48.620
Who is it?

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:51.130
Who's there?

00:21:56.270 --> 00:21:58.330
Who... are you?

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:02.970
<i>Again. Once again,</i>
<i>in this same fashion!</i>

00:22:04.850 --> 00:22:06.780
<i>Reality betrays me.</i>

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:13.740
In your dry eyes...

00:22:13.740 --> 00:22:18.820
...a silhouette appears

00:22:18.820 --> 00:22:23.520
The blue colored future...

00:22:23.520 --> 00:22:30.260
...swayed and glittered

00:22:31.430 --> 00:22:39.670
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:48.280
...freedom out of pity

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:56.720
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:56.720 --> 00:23:00.620
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:23:00.620 --> 00:23:07.000
goodbye

00:23:10.790 --> 00:23:12.620
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:13.560
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: To Be Too Conscious

00:23:13.560 --> 00:23:15.390
Next episode: To Be Too Conscious
We're assaulted in a space shooting
battle initiated by the enemy.

00:23:15.390 --> 00:23:16.160
Next episode: To Be Too Conscious

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:18.990
Next episode: To Be Too Conscious
An invisible chain grabs onto the
weaknesses of the souls of us students...!

00:23:18.990 --> 00:23:19.430
Next episode: To Be Too Conscious

00:23:19.430 --> 00:23:21.900
Next episode: To Be Too Conscious
...who had grown used to battles.

00:23:21.900 --> 00:23:25.430
Next episode: To Be Too Conscious
I was becoming too conscious
about living, and about dying.

00:23:25.430 --> 00:23:26.200
Next episode: To Be Too Conscious

00:23:26.200 --> 00:23:28.000
Next episode: To Be Too Conscious
About that guy
who I thought was far from me...

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:29.710
Next episode: To Be Too Conscious
...and that girl
who I thought was close to me.

00:23:29.710 --> 00:23:31.040
Next episode: To Be Too Conscious
About everything.
